hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"252","Wa qāla ṣallā Allāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam: Aqrabu mā yakūnu al-ʿabdu min rabbihi wa huwa sājidun fa-akthirū al-duʿā’.. And he (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \The closest the servant is to his Lord is while he is in prostration"," so increase in supplication.\"""""
"253","Wa qāla ṣallā Allāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam: Innahu layughānu ʿalā qalbī wa innī laʾastaghfiru Allāha fī al-yawmi miʾata marrah.. And he (peace be upon him) said: \Indeed"," there are moments when my heart becomes heedless"," and I seek the forgiveness of Allah a hundred times a day.\"""""
